  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nature Park YUS Tree Kangaroo Conservation Coffee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In collaboration with the Tree Kangaroo Conservation Program (TKCP) and the YUS Conservation Area which is a community-based conservation in Papua New Guinea, Port Moresby Nature Park seeks to source a coffee roaster &amp; grinding machine to roast coffee beans from the alternative livelihoods program in YUS before they are grinded and packaged. We will sell the end product at our Nature&#x2019;s Gift Shop, Nature&#x2019;s Caf&#xe9;, as well as marketed to our Park sponsors to help raise funds to support the rescue, rehabilitation and awareness of the Matschie&#x2019;s tree kangaroos found in the rural areas of Morobe Province in PNG.</narrative>
  </description>
